 0\nVenue Radar: https://gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#sd4h-2026\nNotes: 
 ICML's official workshop page and the SD4H site confirm Sat Jul 11\, 2026
  in Hall D2\, COEX\, Seoul (ICML lists 8:00-17:00 KST)\; accepted papers 
 had to be presented in person and the workshop is non-archival (no procee
 dings). The site's Prior Years menu links TS4H's NeurIPS 2025\, ICLR 2024
  and NeurIPS 2022 pages and organizers overlap\, but no formal rename is 
